From: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:36:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add QuickLogic

Add the vendor prefix for QuickLogic Corporation, the maker of the CSSP
camera bridge used on the BeagleBone camera capes.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index 396044f36..5d40289e3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1365,6 +1365,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: QNAP Systems, Inc.
   "^quanta,.*":
     description: Quanta Computer Inc.
+  "^quicklogic,.*":
+    description: QuickLogic Corporation
   "^radxa,.*":
     description: Radxa
   "^raidsonic,.*":
